## Server Handlers

### Microsoft OAuth Handler

The [`microsoft.get.ts`](app/server/auth/microsoft.get.ts) handler manages Microsoft Azure authentication:

```typescript
export default defineOAuthMicrosoftEventHandler({
  config: {
    clientId: useRuntimeConfig().microsoftClientId,
    clientSecret: useRuntimeConfig().microsoftClientSecret,
    tenant: useRuntimeConfig().microsoftTenantId || 'common',
    scope: ['openid', 'profile', 'email', 'User.Read'],
  },
  async onSuccess(event, { user }) {
    // Transform and store user data
    const onionUser = {
      id: user.id,
      name: user.displayName || user.name,
      email: user.mail || user.userPrincipalName,
      provider: 'microsoft',
      // ... additional user data
    }
    
    await setUserSession(event, {
      user: onionUser,
      loggedInAt: Date.now(),
    })
    
    // Handle redirect after login
    const redirectUrl = getCookie(event, 'auth-redirect') || '/'
    return sendRedirect(event, redirectUrl)
  },
})
```

### Auth0 OAuth Handler

The [`auth0.get.ts`](app/server/auth/auth0.get.ts) handler manages Auth0 authentication:

```typescript
export default defineOAuthAuth0EventHandler({
  config: {
    clientId: useRuntimeConfig().auth0ClientId,
    clientSecret: useRuntimeConfig().auth0ClientSecret,
    domain: useRuntimeConfig().auth0Domain,
  },
  async onSuccess(event, { user }) {
    // Transform and store user data
    const onionUser = {
      id: user.sub,
      name: user.name,
      email: user.email,
      picture: user.picture,
      provider: 'auth0',
      // ... additional user data
    }
    
    await setUserSession(event, {
      user: onionUser,
      loggedInAt: Date.now(),
    })
    
    return sendRedirect(event, redirectUrl)
  },
  onError(event, error) {
    return sendRedirect(event, '/login?error=auth0_error')
  },
})
```

## Configuration

### Runtime Configuration

The layer uses Nuxt's runtime configuration for secure credential management:

```typescript
// nuxt.config.ts
export default defineNuxtConfig({
  extends: ['onion-auth'],
  
  runtimeConfig: {
    // Server configuration (private)
    authSecret: process.env.NUXT_AUTH_SECRET,
    auth0ClientId: process.env.AUTH0_CLIENT_ID,
    auth0ClientSecret: process.env.AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET,
    auth0Domain: process.env.AUTH0_DOMAIN,
    microsoftClientId: process.env.MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID,
    microsoftClientSecret: process.env.MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET,
    microsoftTenantId: process.env.MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID,
    
    public: {
      // Client configuration (public)
      authBaseURL: process.env.NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_BASE_URL || 'http://localhost:3000'
    }
  }
})
```

