## Integration with UI Layers

### AuthProvider Interface

The layer implements the [`AuthProvider`](shared/types/auth-interfaces.ts) interface for seamless integration with UI layers:

```typescript
interface AuthProvider {
  userSession: Ref<UserSession | null>
  isAuthenticated: ComputedRef<boolean>
  login(provider: string, options?: AuthOptions): Promise<void>
  logout(options?: LogoutOptions): Promise<void>
}
```

### User Session Format

The standardized user session format:

```typescript
interface UserSession {
  user: {
    username?: string
    profile?: {
      id: string
      name?: string
      email?: string
    }
  }
  provider?: string
  loggedInAt?: number
}
```

### Integration Example

```typescript
// In a plugin or composable
export default defineNuxtPlugin(() => {
  const auth = useAuth() // From UI layer
  const onionAuth = useOnionAuth() // From auth layer
  
  // Connect the authentication provider
  auth.setAuthProvider(onionAuth, {
    debug: true,
    userDataTransformer: (session) => ({
      username: session?.user?.profile?.name || session?.user?.username,
      profilePicture: session?.user?.profile?.picture
    })
  })
})
```

